   "cooked": "<p>gm, great stuff! Exciting to see TECs new focus and direction!</p>\n<p>Some quick fire thoughts sharing some bits we are working on that respond to some of the questions raised:</p>\n<p><strong>How can we define and measure regeneration in ways that are credible, transparent, and actually useful?</strong></p>\n<p>Check out:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://blog.refidao.com/refi-ebf-whats-next/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">ReFi &amp; Ecological Benefits Framework - Whats Next?</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://gov.gitcoin.co/t/ai-impactqf-regen-coordination-global-gg23-retrospective/20385?u=montymerlin\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">AI ImpactQF + Regen Coordination Global GG23 Retrospective - 🌱 Gitcoin Grants - Gitcoin Governance</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://carboncopy.news/dashboard/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">ReFi Impact Dashboard | CARBON Copy</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ktlbennett_frontiers-an-evaluation-of-the-regenerative-activity-7335976987464736769-0m0Y\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Frontiers | An evaluation of the regenerative claims of Web3’s ReFi… | Kate Cardona (Bennett) | 11 comments</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>What does alignment look like across so many diverse ReFi projects, values, and communities?</strong></p>\n<p>Regen Coordination.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.regencoordination.xyz/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Resources Hub</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hub.regencoordination.xyz/categories\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Forum Hub</a></li>\n</ol>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://hub.regencoordination.xyz/categories\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"\" src=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/flex004/uploads/greenpill_hub/optimized/1X/d3a81853bce6ac71fe11497f6885cabde4759647_2_32x32.png\" width=\"\"/>\n<a href=\"https://hub.regencoordination.xyz/categories\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Regen Coordination</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<img class=\"thumbnail\" height=\"\" src=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/flex004/uploads/greenpill_hub/original/1X/d3a81853bce6ac71fe11497f6885cabde4759647.png\" width=\"\"/>\n<h3><a href=\"https://hub.regencoordination.xyz/categories\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Regen Coordination</a></h3>\n<p>Building a CoordiNation across Nations &amp; Cultures.</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://jessykate.medium.com/coordi-nations-a-new-institutional-structure-for-global-cooperation-3ef38d6e2cfa\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"\" src=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/5d8de952517e8160e40ef9841c781cdc14a5db313057fa3c3de41c6f5b494b19\" width=\"\"/>\n<a href=\"https://jessykate.medium.com/coordi-nations-a-new-institutional-structure-for-global-cooperation-3ef38d6e2cfa\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"04:02AM - 16 June 2023\">Medium – 16 Jun 23</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<img class=\"thumbnail\" height=\"\" src=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1024/1*zeA3yz6uCudv6WR3_NgLgw.png\" width=\"\"/>\n<h3><a href=\"https://jessykate.medium.com/coordi-nations-a-new-institutional-structure-for-global-cooperation-3ef38d6e2cfa\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Coordi-nations: A New Institutional Structure for Global Cooperation</a></h3>\n<p>Coordi-nations are a new form of network sovereignty designed around voluntary association, participatory governance and mutualism.</p>\n<p>\n<span class=\"label1\">Reading time: 10 min read</span>\n</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><strong>Can blockchain truly enable regenerative systems, or are we just building new tools on the same old foundations?</strong></p>\n<p>yes it can if we build it in the right way. It is a new economic engine and coordination substrate.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/94e1f115c39a2c0311a035ef6d9611a988ff07cb\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/94e1f115c39a2c0311a035ef6d9611a988ff07cb.jpeg\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-06-04 at 10.31.26 am\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2025-06-04 at 10.31.26 am\" data-base62-sha1=\"lf4K6h9i1MhANN7i20EzDO8gQ43\" data-dominant-color=\"181E25\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/94e1f115c39a2c0311a035ef6d9611a988ff07cb_2_690x388.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/94e1f115c39a2c0311a035ef6d9611a988ff07cb_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/94e1f115c39a2c0311a035ef6d9611a988ff07cb_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/94e1f115c39a2c0311a035ef6d9611a988ff07cb_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-06-04 at 10.31.26 am</span><span class=\"informations\">1732×976 114 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/f25e853a3d52f3eb5fa1bc6b3dc17393684e58c6\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/f25e853a3d52f3eb5fa1bc6b3dc17393684e58c6.jpeg\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-06-04 at 10.31.56 am\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2025-06-04 at 10.31.56 am\" data-base62-sha1=\"yA63wMhXd36ceLMi4Gv5hoEC1Qq\" data-dominant-color=\"222528\" height=\"385\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f25e853a3d52f3eb5fa1bc6b3dc17393684e58c6_2_690x385.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f25e853a3d52f3eb5fa1bc6b3dc17393684e58c6_2_690x385.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f25e853a3d52f3eb5fa1bc6b3dc17393684e58c6_2_1035x577.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f25e853a3d52f3eb5fa1bc6b3dc17393684e58c6_2_1380x770.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-06-04 at 10.31.56 am</span><span class=\"informations\">1620×906 93.9 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p><strong>How do we make sure ReFi doesn’t become another inaccessible or elite space?</strong></p>\n<p>Build tools and systems that normal people can use.</p>\n<p><strong>What role should decentralized governance play in shaping this next chapter?</strong></p>\n<p>If interested, check out our approach for ReFi DAO → <a href=\"https://www.regencoordination.xyz/refi-dao-network-structure\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">ReFi DAO Network - Structure, Roles, &amp; Governance</a></p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/6b21971e7cd51fd014e158a2b8a4cbbd14c6cff0\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/6b21971e7cd51fd014e158a2b8a4cbbd14c6cff0.jpeg\" title=\"ReFi DAO Network Structure\"><img alt=\"ReFi DAO Network Structure\" data-base62-sha1=\"fhJ3ucizVfZmtdPhBQTKp2cuNi0\" data-dominant-color=\"43474C\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/6b21971e7cd51fd014e158a2b8a4cbbd14c6cff0_2_690x388.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/6b21971e7cd51fd014e158a2b8a4cbbd14c6cff0_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/6b21971e7cd51fd014e158a2b8a4cbbd14c6cff0_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/6b21971e7cd51fd014e158a2b8a4cbbd14c6cff0_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ReFi DAO Network Structure</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 154 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>",
